e:
Two possible etymologies are traditionally accepted:
* தேம்பா (tēmpā, “unfading, unwithering”) + அணி (aṇi, “arrangement, garland”), translating to 'unfading garland';
* தேன் (tēṉ, “honey”) + பா (pā, “song, poem”) + அணி (aṇi, “arrangement, garland”), translating to 'honey-sweet arrangement of songs.'
